 </span><span begin="02:35.133" end="02:35.294">I'm </span><span begin="02:35.294" end="02:35.794">having </span><span begin="02:35.794" end="02:36.520">visions </span><span begin="02:36.520" end="02:36.731">of </span><span begin="02:36.731" end="02:37.613">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.471" end="02:44.048"><span begin="02:40.471" end="02:40.767">But </span><span begin="02:40.767" end="02:41.079">then </span><span begin="02:41.079" end="02:41.301">I </span><span begin="02:41.301" end="02:44.048">understand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.833" end="02:49.391"><span begin="02:44.833" end="02:44.990">The </span><span begin="02:44.990" end="02:45.145">friend </span><span begin="02:45.145" end="02:45.376">I'm </span><span begin="02:45.376" end="02:46.806">dreaming </span><span begin="02:46.806" end="02:47.040">of </span><span begin="02:47.040" end="02:47.223">is </span><span begin="02:47.223" end="02:47.728">far </span><span begin="02:47.728" end="02:49.391">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.917" end="02:55.565"><span begin="02:51.917" end="02:52.026">And </span><span begin="02:52.026" end="02:52.753">doesn't </span><span begin="02:52.753" end="02:53.963">feel </span><span begin="02:53.963" end="02:54.303">my </span><span begin="02:54.303" end="02:55.565">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.514" end="03:07.605"><span begin="02:59.514" end="02:59.703">But </span><span begin="02:59.703" end="03:00.113">I </span><span begin="03:00.113" end="03:05.858">do </span><span begin="03:05.858" end="03:06.084">I </span><span begin="03:06.084" end="03:07.605">do</span></p></div></body></tt>